{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36350","headline":"镜湖西岛言事寄陶校书 · 方干","name":"镜湖西岛言事寄陶校书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"樵猎两三户，凋疎是近邻。\n风雷前壑雨，花木後岩春。\n文字不得力，桑麻难救贫。\n山禽欺稚子，夜犬吠渔人。\n未必圣明代，长将云水亲。\n知音不延荐，何路出泥尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36350.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36350","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}